// Eraser diagram type: Flow Chart
direction down
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Job received [shape: oval, icon: play, color: green]
Open CSV as a stream [icon: file-text]
Skip rows up to checkpoint_row [icon: skip-forward]
Take next 10k rows [icon: layers]
Keep only mapped columns [icon: filter]
Split chunk across process pool [icon: cpu]

Per row validation [icon: check-circle, color: blue] {
  Row country from country column else default [icon: map-pin]
  Next phone column by priority [icon: list]
  Value empty [shape: diamond]
  Excel scientific notation [shape: diamond]
  Strip non digits [icon: scissors]
  Starts with plus or 00 [shape: diamond, icon: globe]
  Indian mobile fast path [shape: diamond, icon: zap]
  Valid as international number [shape: diamond, icon: search]
  Valid in row country [shape: diamond, icon: search]
  11 plus digits and detect missing plus on [shape: diamond, icon: help-circle]
  Landline and rule enabled [shape: diamond, icon: phone-off]
  Remember first reason [icon: bookmark]
  More phone columns [shape: diamond]
  Valid E164 number [shape: oval, icon: check, color: green]
  Rejected with reason [shape: oval, icon: x, color: red]
}

Valid rows batch [icon: check-square, color: green]
Rejected rows batch [icon: x-square, color: red]
Save chunk in one transaction [icon: database, color: purple]
More rows in file [shape: diamond]
Mark import done [shape: oval, icon: flag, color: green]

