Next phone column by priority > Value empty
Value empty > More phone columns: yes
Value empty > Excel scientific notation: no
Excel scientific notation > Remember first reason: yes sci_notation
Excel scientific notation > Strip non digits: no
Strip non digits > Indian mobile fast path: India or +91
Indian mobile fast path > Landline and rule enabled: match
Indian mobile fast path > Starts with plus or 00: no match
Starts with plus or 00 > Valid as international number: yes
Starts with plus or 00 > Valid in row country: no
Valid in row country > Landline and rule enabled: yes
Valid in row country > 11 plus digits and detect missing plus on: no
11 plus digits and detect missing plus on > Valid as international number: yes retry with plus
11 plus digits and detect missing plus on > Remember first reason: no invalid
Valid as international number > Landline and rule enabled: yes
Valid as international number > Remember first reason: no invalid
Landline and rule enabled > Remember first reason: yes landline
Landline and rule enabled > Valid E164 number: no
Remember first reason > More phone columns
More phone columns > Next phone column by priority: yes
More phone columns > Rejected with reason: no
Valid E164 number > Valid rows batch
Rejected with reason > Rejected rows batch
Valid rows batch > Save chunk in one transaction
Rejected rows batch > Save chunk in one transaction
Save chunk in one transaction > More rows in file
More rows in file > Take next 10k rows: yes
More rows in file > Mark import done: no
